 \binom{\lfloor k\sqrt D\rfloor+k}{k}
 \leq [2e(1+\sqrt D)]^k.\] Combined with a sufficiently small bad-block probability this retains exponential decay. The factor-two radius notation on p. 966 is not used here as a separate substantive finding: a path with \(2km+1\) vertices corresponds to radius \(km\) under the definition on p. 881. These local checks do not replace a complete verification of Proposition 8.1, Lemma 10.3, the Busemann estimates, or the integrable-probability inputs.

