 \dim_H\operatorname{supp}_{\rm top}\mu^\beta=1 .\] For \(\beta=4\) the displayed value in Corollary 2.4 is \(1/2\). For \(\beta=2\) it is \(0\). The discrepancy is thus an actual almost-sure counterexample under the prescribed distributions, not a pathological choice of coefficients outside the assumptions.

