                    -\xi\cdot\nabla\psi_\varepsilon\right).\] Thus the remainder is controlled by \(E_\varepsilon\) and does not by itself refute Proposition 2.9. The three-square estimate on p. 36 should also use a generic constant (for example the usual factor \(3\)), rather than coefficient one; that constant is absorbed in the same estimate.

